peoples in equity,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"And shalt guide the nations on the earth. Pause.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Let the peoples, O God, give thanks to thee;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Let all the peoples give thanks to thee.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The earth has yielded her fruit;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Let God, our God, bless us.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Let God bless us;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"And let all the ends of the earth fear him.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_boy/PSA/66.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_boy/PSA/67.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_boy/PSA/65.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}